WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.189
A migration from react-i18next
replaces each key with its source

2
00:00:05.189 --> 00:00:05.791
text.

3
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:10.782
General Translation's gt-react
runs next to react-i18next as

4
00:00:10.782 --> 00:00:12.511
you move components inline.

5
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:19.535
Install gt-react, and have i18next
read gt-react's locale cookie.

6
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.298
Then move one component at a time,

7
00:00:22.298 --> 00:00:26.151
from keys and Trans to inline
copy in the T component.

8
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:30.285
For placeholders and
other strings outside JSX,

9
00:00:30.285 --> 00:00:31.433
call useGT.

10
00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:37.038
Run npx gt translate, and General
Translation translates moved

11
00:00:37.038 --> 00:00:39.916
copy with its JSX as context.

12
00:00:40.316 --> 00:00:42.754
Your team can correct
it in the Dashboard,

13
00:00:42.754 --> 00:00:46.201
and unmoved components keep
their reviewed translations.

14
00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:49.389
Your team now ships
Polish with each release.
